<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Sophisticated Multi-Currency Invoicing</h2>
        <p>
            Eliminate billing errors with automated fee schedules. Define term fees per form, 
            grade, and boarding status, adding ancillary charges for uniforms, exams, or 
            excursions with structural precision. The system manages simultaneous billing 
            in USD and ZiG, applying complex sibling discounts and partial scholarship 
            deductions automatically during invoice generation. Every family receives 
            a clear, professional statement through their portal, ensuring radical 
            transparency of their financial standing with the institution.
        </p>
        <p>
            ZIMRA-compliant fiscal receipt generation ensures that the school's finance 
            office meets national reporting standards from the moment a deposit is 
            recorded.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Integrated Payment Reconciliation</h2>
        <p>
            Accelerate your cash-flow through integrated payment capture across all primary 
            channels—EcoCash, ZiPay, bank transfers, and cash collections. Frame 
            facilitates rapid reconciliation by matching electronic payment references 
            with student invoices, providing the finance office with a real-time 
            view of global liquidity across all bank accounts and mobile wallets.
        </p>
        <p>
            Manual record-keeping is minimized, freeing staff to focus on strategic 
            financial stewardship and arrears management.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Automated Arrears & Clearance Engine</h2>
        <p>
            Maintain organizational sustainability with high-integrity credit control. Frame's 
            notification engine automatically identifies overdue accounts and triggers 
            personalized WhatsApp or SMS reminders to parents. To protect school revenue, 
            the 'Fee Clearance' engine provides a hard-link between financial status 
            and service delivery—automatically restricting access to report cards 
            or term-end activities for accounts with significant outstanding 
            balances.
        </p>
        <p>
            Deep financial analytics—including debt aging and collection velocity trends—provide 
            the school board with the empirical data needed for effective financial 
            planning and fee-setting strategies.
        </p>
    </div>
